{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X在S07省掉了“早知道这样，自己还会不会走”的反事实犹疑，人物后悔与自我追问的层次比Y少了一点。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"平\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的优势在于话语被拆成容易扫读的短单元，关键心理节点有明确强调，感受又按音乐进程陆续出现，不需要观众同时处理一大堆并列词语。它把离开受气、怀念亲近、害怕孤单、不愿再次委屈自己、最终带着想念向前的主线串得比较清楚，音乐感受也有具体的身体反应、声音质地和情绪变化。Y在个别心理转折上解释得更完整，但整体上X更容易让普通观众边听边读，同时获得叙事和感受两方面的信息。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "985e12dc-ee4e-41b6-b3ef-c10028e99cd9", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T205523974872Z", "elapsed_seconds": 75.203, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T20:56:39.186700+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "20d34d6f23e0c4b68413251cfe9fee3ac73b578414286d894f7674372d574077", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_